chapter.v:
Ashhur, the 


father of, 


Tekoa, had two wives, Helah and Naarah;

The sons 


of Shelah, 


the son of Judah: Er the father of Lecah, Laadah the father of Mareshah, and the clans of the house of linen workers at Beth-ashbea;

The sons 


of Simeon:, 


Nemuel, Jamin, Jarib, Zerah, Shaul;
